BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Aquatic Wonder-Macroinvertebrates\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260713T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260713T153000
UID:dcdf9a1910c500542efd7fe4d1d73adf@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) There are worlds that exist that are hard for us to see
 . Let&rsquo\;s grab a pair of rubber boots to look at our macro-invertebra
 te world. Meet in front of the Canyon Inn to begin our hike to the waterfa
 ll to look for tiny insects with Naturalist Jessica. This hike has stairs 
 down into the canyon. Today we will learn how rock stacking can impact the
  ecology of aquatic insects and the salamanders that eat them. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
