UID:bd26d2f47946dbe82232415d6a89c6fb@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Arts\, Blues\, and BBQ at McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek
  State Park. All events will be held at the Nature Center parking lot. Sho
 p at our local art vendor booths. Bring a lawn chair to enjoy live blues m
 usic from our band line up listed below. Smokin&rsquo\; Jacks food truck w
 ill be onsite offering BBQ to purchase. Sweet Valley Ice Cream will be off
 ering hand scooped ice-cream treats. The Canyon Inn will offer walking tac
 os\, hot dogs\, beer\, and wine for purchase.
