SUMMARY:Archaeology Day\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260920T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260920T160000
UID:b8596883a60b795dab812499cdc673b3@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Event) Join the White River Valley Archaeological Association
  for a family fun day of Native American Culture. Learn how to flint knap 
 or throw spears used by various tribes for hunting. Visit Exhibits to lear
 n archeological facts. All programs are happening at the Nature Center.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
